Valsex OS
=========

Valsex is an operating system. It manages hardware,
system resources, and provides the fundamental services
for all other software.

Quick Start
-----------

* Submit a PR: See docs/process/submit-pr
* Get the release's sources:
-  See https://gitee.com/smoa-new/valsex/releases
* Build the sources: See docs/users/building
* Join the community: See docs/contri/join
* Q and A About Contributing: See docs/contri/q-and-a

